{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115753","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115753/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115753/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115753/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115753","id":3885276011,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7nlJtr","number":115753,"title":"When creating a script that inherits from a custom global class, the behavior in 4.6 differs from 4.5.1 and includes a functional regression:","user":{"login":"NihilityAsh","id":101955347,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhO3Ew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101955347?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NihilityAsh","html_url":"https://github.com/NihilityAsh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NihilityAsh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NihilityAsh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NihilityAsh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NihilityAsh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NihilityAsh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NihilityAsh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NihilityAsh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NihilityAsh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NihilityAsh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-02T10:52:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T10:56:27Z","closed_at":"2026-02-02T10:56:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nVersion: 4.6.stable.mono(Bug)\nComparison Version: 4.5.1.mono(No Bug)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - AMD Ryzen 9 7940HX with Radeon Graphics (32 threads) - 15.21 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen creating a script that inherits from a custom global class, the behavior in 4.6 differs from 4.5.1 and includes a functional regression:\n\nIn 4.5.1: The \"Inherits\" field automatically populates with the global class name of the target script (e.g., NewScript). Path validation works correctly, and the script can be created successfully.\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1516\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d69b803f-ba97-4e7c-ace5-a98472606547\" />\n\nIn 4.6: The \"Inherits\" field automatically populates with the file path of the target script (e.g., res://new_script.gd). Even when the path is correct, the editor shows the error message \"The inherited parent class name or path is invalid\", the \"Create\" button is disabled, and the script cannot be created.\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1516\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0582d1d-4d54-46c4-9923-17707b30f8db\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a new GDScript in Godot, e.g., new_script.gd, and define a global class name at the top of the script:\n\nclass_name NewScript\nextends Node\n\nSave the script.\nAttempt to create a new script that inherits from this global class.\nObserve the \"Inherits\" field value and the error message in 4.6.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115753/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115753/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}